# Match Production to the native Plans table layout

Refine the Production matrix so it shares the Plans table's fixed header, icon column, typography, density, and scrolling behavior.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] The Production/Plans picker stays fixed at the top when changing sections or scrolling Production.
- [ ] The Production matrix fills the remaining content area without vertically repositioning the Analysis header.
- [ ] The resource column is fixed while only player-value columns scroll horizontally.
- [ ] `Avg production per round` and `Avg rounds until one produced` span only the values viewport.
- [ ] All, Brick, Ore, Wheat, Sheep, and Wood restore their resource icons.
- [ ] Production typography, row height, separators, backgrounds, and padding match Plans.
- [ ] The White player column heading uses grey text; other headings retain their player colour.
- [ ] Section arrow and horizontal swipe continue to toggle the Production metric.
- [ ] UI regression coverage compiles.
- [ ] Focused checks pass on a functioning simulator or device.

